  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-1674\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's remind ourselves of the special trigonometric ratios, as given by the unit circle.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-1674-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-1674-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>Let's consider the angle <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> From the unit circle, we see that the angle <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselect